# DESK05 run B -- edit a shortcut key and commit it with OK, then Save desktop.
#   File title centre ~ (88, 8)  (" Desk " is 16..64, " File " 64..112).
#   Options entry 7  "Desktop configuration..." centre y = 139
#   Options entry 11 "Save desktop..."          centre y = 203
#   ADDESKCF ROOT (164,105) 312x288:  DCOK centre (256,369)
#   IKBD raw scancodes: BACKSPACE make 0E / break 8E, X make 2D / break AD.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 88 8
2200 mark B_FILEMENU
2500 move 400 300
2700 down
2703 up
